{"slug": "university-scout-forums", "kind": "program", "host": "Iraq Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research (MoHESR)", "title_ar": "ملتقيات الكشافة الجامعية", "title_en": "University Scout forums", "summary_ar": "ملتقيات للكشافة الجامعية تنظمها لجنة الكشافة في وزارة التعليم العالي والبحث العلمي العراقية لطلبة الجامعات العراقية. أقيم آخرها في البصرة من 30 نوفمبر إلى 4 ديسمبر 2025 بمشاركة أكثر من 53 مؤسسة. لم يُذكر موعد الملتقى المقبل ولا التكاليف.", "summary_en": "University scout forums run by the Scouting Committee of Iraq's Ministry of Higher Education, for students at Iraqi universities. The latest was in Basra, Nov 30 to Dec 4, 2025, with 53+ institutions. The next forum and costs are not stated.", "location": "Iraq", "remote": false, "apply_url": null, "applicant_fee": 0, "fee_note": null, "opens_at": null, "deadline": null, "levels": ["undergraduate"], "min_age": null, "max_age": null, "destination_countries": ["IQ"], "funding_type": "unknown", "iraqi_eligibility": "named_relay", "source_url": "https://uoninevah.edu.iq/?p=69046", "last_checked_on": "2026-11-04"},
{"slug": "vex-robotics-iraq-qualifiers", "kind": "competition", "host": "VEX Robotics", "title_ar": "تصفيات VEX Robotics في العراق", "title_en": "VEX Robotics Iraq Qualifiers", "summary_ar": "تصفيات عراقية لبطولة العالم VEX Robotics لفرق المدارس، أقيمت في أربيل وفي الجامعة الأمريكية في السليمانية عام 2025. تكفلت Toyota Iraq برحلة الفائز عام 2025 إلى البطولة العالمية، ولم تُذكر السنوات الأخرى. لم يُعثر على موعد لعام 2026-27.", "summary_en": "Iraqi qualifiers for the VEX Robotics world championship, for school teams, held in Erbil and at AUIS in 2025. Toyota Iraq sponsored the 2025 winner's trip to Worlds; other years are not stated. No 2026-27 date has been found.", "location": "Iraq; Worlds in the United States", "remote": false, "apply_url": null, "applicant_fee": 0, "fee_note": null, "opens_at": null, "deadline": null, "levels": ["high_school"], "min_age": null, "max_age": null, "destination_countries": ["IQ", "US"], "funding_type": "unknown", "iraqi_eligibility": "named_relay", "source_url": "https://www.toyota.iq/english/news-releases/vex-competition", "last_checked_on": "2026-11-04"},
