{"slug": "chevening-scholarships", "kind": "scholarship", "host": "UK Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO)", "title_ar": "منحة Chevening", "title_en": "Chevening Scholarships", "summary_ar": "منحة ماجستير ممولة بالكامل لمدة سنة في المملكة المتحدة من وزارة الخارجية والكومنولث والتنمية البريطانية، ولها صفحة خاصة بالعراق ودون حد أعلى للعمر. تشمل الرسوم والسفر بالدرجة الاقتصادية والمخصصات والتأشيرة وفحص السل وراتبًا شهريًا. أُغلقت دورة 2027-28.", "summary_en": "A fully funded one-year master's scholarship in the UK from the Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office, with an Iraq page and no upper age limit. Covers tuition, economy travel, allowances, visa, a TB test and a monthly stipend. The 2027-28 round has closed.", "location": "United Kingdom", "remote": false, "apply_url": "https://www.chevening.org/scholarship/iraq/", "applicant_fee": 0, "fee_note": null, "opens_at": null, "deadline": "2026-10-06T23:59:59+03:00", "levels": ["masters"], "min_age": null, "max_age": null, "destination_countries": ["GB"], "funding_type": "fully_funded", "iraqi_eligibility": "named_official", "source_url": "https://www.chevening.org/scholarship/iraq/", "last_checked_on": "2026-11-04"},
