{"slug": "fulbright-foreign-student-program-iraq", "kind": "scholarship", "host": "US Department of State", "title_ar": "برنامج Fulbright للطلبة الأجانب (العراق)", "title_en": "Fulbright Foreign Student Program (Iraq)", "summary_ar": "منحة ماجستير ممولة بالكامل لسنتين في الولايات المتحدة في كل التخصصات عدا العلوم الطبية، للمواطنين والمقيمين المؤهلين في العراق ممن لديهم خبرة عمل سنتين بعد التخرج. تدفع الرسوم وراتبًا شهريًا ومزايا صحية محدودة والسفر ورسوم الاختبارات. ستُعلن الدورة المقبلة لاحقًا.", "summary_en": "A fully funded two-year US master's in any field except medical sciences, for citizens or eligible residents living in Iraq with 2+ years' post-graduation work. Pays tuition, a monthly stipend, limited health benefits, round-trip travel and test fees. Next cycle to be announced.", "location": "United States", "remote": false, "apply_url": "https://iq.usembassy.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2026/02/Program-Announcement.pdf", "applicant_fee": 0, "fee_note": null, "opens_at": null, "deadline": "2026-05-01T23:59:59+03:00", "levels": ["masters"], "min_age": null, "max_age": null, "destination_countries": ["US"], "funding_type": "fully_funded", "iraqi_eligibility": "named_official", "source_url": "https://iq.usembassy.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2026/02/Program-Announcement.pdf", "last_checked_on": "2026-11-04"},
