{"slug": "icgeb-postdoctoral-fellowships", "kind": "scholarship", "host": "ICGEB", "title_ar": "زمالات ICGEB لما بعد الدكتوراه", "title_en": "ICGEB Postdoctoral Fellowships", "summary_ar": "زمالات ممولة بالكامل لما بعد الدكتوراه لسنتين مع سنة إضافية محتملة في Trieste أو نيودلهي أو كيب تاون، يقدمها ICGEB. تدفع 2,300 يورو أو 1,749 دولارًا أو 27,500 راند شهريًا مع التأمين والسفر والتأشيرة. تتطلب تزكية من مسؤول الاتصال العراقي.", "summary_en": "Fully funded two-year postdoctoral fellowships, with one possible extra year, in Trieste, New Delhi or Cape Town, from ICGEB, for nationals of member states including Iraq. Pays EUR 2,300, US$1,749 or ZAR 27,500 monthly plus insurance, travel and visa. Needs Liaison Officer endorsement.", "location": "Trieste, New Delhi and Cape Town", "remote": false, "apply_url": "https://www.icgeb.org/fellowships/arturo-falaschi-postdoctoral-fellowships-2/", "applicant_fee": 0, "fee_note": null, "opens_at": null, "deadline": "2026-09-30T23:59:59+03:00", "levels": ["postdoc"], "min_age": null, "max_age": null, "destination_countries": ["IT", "IN", "ZA"], "funding_type": "fully_funded", "iraqi_eligibility": "named_official", "source_url": "https://www.icgeb.org/fellowships/arturo-falaschi-postdoctoral-fellowships-2/", "last_checked_on": "2026-11-04"},
